{"id":118186570,"slug":"a-guide-to-missing-out-on-blue-sky","title":"A Guide to Missing Out On Blue Sky, The Hot Invite Only App You Are Not On","subtitle":"I've already published a book to cash in... as performance art.","post_date":"2023-05-05T06:15:16.735Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/a-guide-to-missing-out-on-blue-sky","wordcount":424,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:59:31.394Z","body_sha256":"f5362c7879482e898b193697bd141995a985a47ca80351a2bab722493a9b2289","text_words":426,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>Have you heard about BlueSky Social?</p><p>The Story Thus Far….</p><ul><li><p>Someone bought Twitter.  </p></li><li><p>Jack Dorsey and a bunch of extremely prolific developers build a federated competitor.</p></li><li><p>I got an invite.  @psychiatrist.bsky.social</p></li><li><p>Somebody figure out how to make an artificial intelligence duck. </p><p></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DyBU!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F94457950-bc26-4c24-a8d2-5030566370e5_1290x976.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DyBU!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F94457950-bc26-4c24-a8d2-5030566370e5_1290x976.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DyBU!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F94457950-bc26-4c24-a8d2-5030566370e5_1290x976.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DyBU!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amaz