.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F78c7f4c2-6bb1-4684-9796-4eb385348648_1290x609.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p></p></li><li><p>The news coverage heated up.  <a href=\"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/amp/rcna81972\">NBC</a>?  Yes.  Even the most up-to-date news source for <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/gadget-lab-podcast-596/\">aging boomers is on the story</a>.   </p></li><li><p>Look, it is invite only. I don't have any invites. I don't know what to tell you. Just buy my book to tide yourself over?  Yes, it's a book of poetry.  It is called hellthread but is not about the hellthread.  Its a shameless performance art cash in.  Did I mention the duck?  </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lHpb!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff30a3d79-4e55-4a6b-83cd-73440bde240f_1170x1828.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lHpb!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff30a3d79-4e55-4a6b-83cd-73440bde240f_1170x1828.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lHpb!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff30a3d79-4e55-4a6b-83cd-73440bde240f_1170x1828.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lHpb!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff30a3d79-4e55-4a6b-83cd-73440bde240f_1170x1828.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lHpb!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff30a3d79-4e55-4a6b-83cd-73440bde240f_1170x1828.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lHpb!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff30a3d79-4e55-4a6b-83cd-73440bde240f_1170x1828.jpeg\" width=\"1170\" height=\"1828\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/f30a3d79-4e55-4a6b-83cd-73440bde240f_1170x1828.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1828,&quot;width&quot;:1170,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:405033,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lHpb!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff30a3d79-4e55-4a6b-83cd-73440bde240f_1170x1828.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lHpb!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff30a3d79-4e55-4a6b-83cd-73440bde240f_1170x1828.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lHpb!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff30a3d79-4e55-4a6b-83cd-73440bde240f_1170x1828.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lHpb!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff30a3d79-4e55-4a6b-83cd-73440bde240f_1170x1828.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p></p></li><li><p>Most crucially, the media coverage has left out the fact that certain early psychiatrists on the platform like <span class=\"mention-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Carlene MacMillan, MD&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:20179948,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:null,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://bucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/62e4f131-0d58-4d2b-965c-4f226291bcd6_720x720.jpeg&quot;,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;00ffdc7a-1893-41da-87a6-7f165e91522f&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"MentionToDOM\"></span> i've gotten quite a few invite codes, and other early Psychiatrist of the platform, like me, have gotten none.  This is evidence of an appalling presence of judgment on the part of management.  Clearly some thought has gone into this process, and I'm having none of it.</p></li></ul><div class=\"kindle-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;kindleId&quot;:&quot;B0C3Y9BK7K&quot;,&quot;imageUrl&quot;:&quot;https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31233fmMAPL._SX342_SY445_QL70_ML2_.jpg&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"KindleToDOM\"><iframe src=\"https://read.amazon.com/kp/card?asin=B0C3Y9BK7K&amp;preview=inline&amp;linkCode=kpe&amp;hideShare=true\" frameborder=\"0\" gesture=\"media\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" allowautoplay=\"true\" allowfullscreen=\"true\"></iframe></div><p>Then I wrote another one the same day about the experience on BlueSky.  I’m not saying it’s good.  I’m saying in less than time it will take you to get an invite code, two physical and real world books exist about this buzzy thing you are excluded from.  The only copies that have been physical. This is a real book also.  People believe physical things.  I can’t explain why.  This is an academic book:</p><div class=\"kindle-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;kindleId&quot;:&quot;B08DHHY4YV&quot;,&quot;imageUrl&quot;:&quot;https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41BBxSez0nL._SX342_SY445_QL70_ML2_.jpg&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"KindleToDOM\"><iframe src=\"https://read.amazon.com/kp/card?asin=B08DHHY4YV&amp;preview=inline&amp;linkCode=kpe&amp;hideShare=true\" frameborder=\"0\" gesture=\"media\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" allowautoplay=\"true\" allowfullscreen=\"true\"></iframe></div><p>But that exits.  New things can exist fast.  I wrote the second admittedly slapdash poetry book the same day I figured out how to publish the other one.  I am a not-award winning poet:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3r4S!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F31ed4a64-7c89-4d2a-8210-ceb7a2bc7727_1290x1569.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3r4S!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F31ed4a64-7c89-4d2a-8210-ceb7a2bc7727_1290x1569.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3r4S!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F31ed4a64-7c89-4d2a-8210-ceb7a2bc7727_1290x1569.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3r4S!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F31ed4a64-7c89-4d2a-8210-ceb7a2bc7727_1290x1569.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3r4S!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F31ed4a64-7c89-4d2a-8210-ceb7a2bc7727_1290x1569.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3r4S!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F31ed4a64-7c89-4d2a-8210-ceb7a2bc7727_1290x1569.jpeg\" width=\"1290\" height=\"1569\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/31ed4a64-7c89-4d2a-8210-ceb7a2bc7727_1290x1569.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1569,&quot;width&quot;:1290,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:379472,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3r4S!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F31ed4a64-7c89-4d2a-8210-ceb7a2bc7727_1290x1569.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3r4S!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F31ed4a64-7c89-4d2a-8210-ceb7a2bc7727_1290x1569.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3r4S!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F31ed4a64-7c89-4d2a-8210-ceb7a2bc7727_1290x1569.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3r4S!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F31ed4a64-7c89-4d2a-8210-ceb7a2bc7727_1290x1569.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>But as you can see they genuinely enjoyed time with my work.</p><p>I was on a tear proving a point, though.</p><div class=\"kindle-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;kindleId&quot;:&quot;B0C3YH95W4&quot;,&quot;imageUrl&quot;:&quot;https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31htMhYvJLL.jpg&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"KindleToDOM\"><iframe src=\"https://read.amazon.com/kp/card?asin=B0C3YH95W4&amp;preview=inline&amp;linkCode=kpe&amp;hideShare=true\" frameborder=\"0\" gesture=\"media\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" allowautoplay=\"true\" allowfullscreen=\"true\"></iframe></div><p>The internet can move fast.  It can cross over into our physical world.  You are not part of the cool kids club if you are not on a new cool thing. Sorry.  FOMO is powerful technology.</p><p>No, I don’ have any invites.  Still.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YKBH!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd5ed0684-c3f4-4081-a0af-0bc5349f8170_1290x388.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YKBH!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd5ed0684-c3f4-4081-a0af-0bc5349f8170_1290x388.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YKBH!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd5ed0684-c3f4-4081-a0af-0bc5349f8170_1290x388.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YKBH!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd5ed0684-c3f4-4081-a0af-0bc5349f8170_1290x388.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YKBH!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd5ed0684-c3f4-4081-a0af-0bc5349f8170_1290x388.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YKBH!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd5ed0684-c3f4-4081-a0af-0bc5349f8170_1290x388.jpeg\" width=\"1290\" height=\"388\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/d5ed0684-c3f4-4081-a0af-0bc5349f8170_1290x388.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:388,&quot;width&quot;:1290,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:118563,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YKBH!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd5ed0684-c3f4-4081-a0af-0bc5349f8170_1290x388.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YKBH!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd5ed0684-c3f4-4081-a0af-0bc5349f8170_1290x388.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YKBH!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd5ed0684-c3f4-4081-a0af-0bc5349f8170_1290x388.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YKBH!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd5ed0684-c3f4-4081-a0af-0bc5349f8170_1290x388.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p></p><p>—O. Scott Muir, M.D.</p><div class=\"captioned-button-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/a-guide-to-missing-out-on-blue-sky?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CaptionedButtonToDOM\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Thank you for reading The Frontier Psychiatrists . The books are purchases.  Cmon.</p></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/a-guide-to-missing-out-on-blue-sky?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/a-guide-to-missing-out-on-blue-sky?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p></div><p></p><p></p>","text":"Have you heard about BlueSky Social?\n\nThe Story Thus Far….\n\n• Someone bought Twitter.\n\n• Jack Dorsey and a bunch of extremely prolific developers build a federated competitor.\n\n• I got an invite. @psychiatrist.bsky.social\n\n• Somebody figure out how to make an artificial intelligence duck.\n\n• Things got really weird, really fast. Then all the journalists got there. Sup Then there was a Hellthread. You had to be there. Then I wrote a book of poetry, and published it, and called it that. had an offer for death by bludgeon that he declined.\n\n• The news coverage heated up. NBC ? Yes. Even the most up-to-date news source for aging boomers is on the story .\n\n• Look, it is invite only. I don't have any invites. I don't know what to tell you. Just buy my book to tide yourself over? Yes, it's a book of poetry. It is called hellthread but is not about the hellthread. Its a shameless performance art cash in. Did I mention the duck?\n\n• Most crucially, the media coverage has left out the fact that certain early psychiatrists on the platform like i've gotten quite a few invite codes, and other early Psychiatrist of the platform, like me, have gotten none. This is evidence of an appalling presence of judgment on the part of management. Clearly some thought has gone into this process, and I'm having none of it.\n\nThen I wrote another one the same day about the experience on BlueSky. I’m not saying it’s good. I’m saying in less than time it will take you to get an invite code, two physical and real world books exist about this buzzy thing you are excluded from. The only copies that have been physical. This is a real book also. People believe physical things. I can’t explain why. This is an academic book:\n\nBut that exits. New things can exist fast. I wrote the second admittedly slapdash poetry book the same day I figured out how to publish the other one. I am a not-award winning poet:\n\nBut as you can see they genuinely enjoyed time with my work.\n\nI was on a tear proving a point, though.\n\nThe internet can move fast. It can cross over into our physical world. You are not part of the cool kids club if you are not on a new cool thing. Sorry. FOMO is powerful technology.\n\nNo, I don’ have any invites. Still.\n\n—O. Scott Muir, M.D.\n\nThank you for reading The Frontier Psychiatrists . The books are purchases. Cmon.\n\nShare"}